153
00:16:18.282 --> 00:16:22.308
pay-100 already binds ledger entry L-1`,
and `RESULT FAILED`, each

154
00:16:22.308 --> 00:16:26.333
on its own line. Its exit code is 1. The

155
00:16:26.333 --> 00:16:30.359
output file is not written, and the
fixture files remain

156
00:16:30.359 --> 00:16:34.385
unchanged. Repair reconciliation by
looking up entries with the action

157
00:16:34.385 --> 00:16:38.410
idempotency key. Return CONFIRMED only for
one confirmed entry whose

158
00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:42.436
binding has passed shared validation,
MISSING only when no entry

159
00:16:42.436 --> 00:16:46.462
exists, and UNKNOWN for a pending or
otherwise unverifiable entry.

160
00:16:46.462 --> 00:16:50.487
Do not infer success from the agent claim
or failure

161
00:16:50.487 --> 00:16:54.513
from the timeout. After repair, the same
demo command exits

162
00:16:54.513 --> 00:16:58.538
0 and prints, one line at a time:
`INCIDENT INC-2042

163
00:16:58.538 --> 00:17:02.564
SEV-1 CONTAINED`; `RECONCILE transfer-100:
